    "legend_note": "Half the residents are older than this, half younger. Computed from single years of age, interpolated within the year. The scale diverges around 47, the median commune: blue is younger, red older. Nationally the median person is 42, but the median commune is 47 — the older a commune's population, the fewer people it tends to hold, so the map looks older than the country is."
